    "htmlEn": "\n<p><strong>🔥 TECH TEA WITH MR. LAM &amp; MR. FLOWERS – EXCLUSIVE SHARING SERIES FROM ENGINEERPRO</strong></p><p><strong>📆 Launch date: April 26, 2025</strong></p><p>Only  <strong>999k</strong>  You will be able to sip a cup of tea with our two founders!</p><p><div><div class=\"embed-16x9\"><iframe frameborder=\"0\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/UA4bNOiO2cg\"></iframe></div></div></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://file.hstatic.net/200000696647/file/0_2df880e71ebd4a1d947f120235ead4d7.png\"/></p><p><strong>☕ Let's sip a cup of tea &amp; receive tips on conquering Big Tech from two interviewing \"gods of war\"!</strong></p><p><em>🚀 Have you ever wondered: How to pass interviews at Google, Meta, TikTok...?</em></p><p><em>🚀 Are you worried about DSA, System Design, or Behavior interview?</em></p><p><em>🚀 Do you want to know how to \"survive\" and advance in the Big Tech environment?</em></p><p><em>So do you want to learn from those who have conquered and passed many Big Tech companies?</em></p><div><div class=\"embed-16x9\"><iframe frameborder=\"0\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/fRtAhdSU5nI\"></iframe></div></div><p><strong>Don't miss the series of 10 \"Tech Tea with Mr. Lam &amp; Mr. Hoa\" sessions via video - where you can sip a cup of tea and receive valuable sharing from two \"veterans\" in the industry:</strong></p><ul><li>Mr. Lam – Senior SWE at TikTok, ex-Senior Engineer at Grab &amp; Motional</li><li>Mr. Hoa – Senior SWE at Airwallex, ex-Tech Lead at TikTok</li></ul><div><p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://file.hstatic.net/200000696647/file/2_ba956b20e705493fae72e2cbc8a5b93a.png\"/></p></div><p>💥 With extensive experience in the industry, the two have directly trained more than 1,500+ engineers at EngineerPro, accompanying them on their journey to conquer Big Tech through in-depth courses on Behavioral Interview, System Design and DSA/Algorithm.</p><p>💥 Directly participate in hundreds of interviews at TikTok, Grab, Visa, Google, Meta... as both interviewee and interviewer</p><div><div class=\"embed-16x9\"><iframe frameborder=\"0\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5nUypf82brY\"></iframe></div></div><p>🎯 What's in this series?</p><ul><li>Session 1: Introduction</li><li>Session 2: DSA Technical Interviews Preparation</li><li>Session 3: System Design Interview Preparation</li><li>Session 4: Computer Science Fundamentals Interview Preparation</li><li>Session 5: Behavioral Interview Preparation</li><li>Session 6: The Power of Effective Communication in Interview</li><li>Session 7: Seamlessly Onboarding at a New Company</li><li>Session 8: Expanding Your Professional Network in Tech</li><li>Session 9: Navigating Career Growth &amp; Promotions</li><li>Session 10: Surviving and Advancing Your Career in Big Tech Amid Layoffs</li></ul><p>Note: This series shares experiences, tips... and cannot replace courses at EngineerPro</p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://file.hstatic.net/200000696647/file/1_f63c7c39806048679f07bb122e0fb6b7.png\"/></p><div><div class=\"embed-16x9\"><iframe frameborder=\"0\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HCIOkkxfUEI\"></iframe></div></div><p>🔥 A unique opportunity to learn from those who have fought in Big Tech!</p><p>👉 Register today and get ready to breakthrough your career!</p><p>Inbox  <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/EngineerPro.Official\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">fanpage</a>  Get detailed advice from the EP team now.</p>"
