    "htmlEn": "\n<p><em><strong>Reference: BACKEND GOLANG course</strong></em></p><p>According to TopDev's 2021 survey on programming positions that employers need most, the Backend programmer position ranked second with 65.1% of votes from employers. Among the popular Backend technologies,  <strong>Java Spring and Golang</strong>  Highlights are the top choices.</p><h2><strong>1. Course content BACKEND JAVA WITH SPRING</strong></h2><p>Java Spring not only helps increase programming productivity but also ensures high performance and good maintainability for long-term projects.  </p><p><em><strong>Backend Java course at Engineer includes 9 TOPICS taught by 100% instructors from BIG TECH (Amazon, Shopee, TikTok, Grab, Uber, ...):  </strong></em></p><ul><li><p>Networking, OS, Unit Tests, GIT, Code Review Process.</p></li><li><p>Database + ORM Dependency Injection, Repository Pattern.</p></li><li><p>Cache: Local Cache, DB Cache.</p></li><li><p>System Design, Design Principles.</p></li><li><p>Monitor, Dashboard, Alerts, SEV, Weekly Metrics Review, COE.</p></li><li><p>Unit Test, Integration Test, End To End Test, Stress Test, Api First Test.</p></li><li><p>Web Security.</p></li><li><p>CICD, Infrastructure as CODE.</p></li><li><p>Async Patterns, Microservices.</p></li></ul><p>And especially, you will be  <em><strong>Engineer Pro builds its own Project.</strong></em></p><p><img alt=\"BACK END JAVA\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://file.hstatic.net/200000696647/file/back_end_java_5bfefe1e04d846208621192a4cf838fc.png\"/></p><h2><strong>2. Benefits of participating in the Backend Java course at Engineer Pro</strong></h2><ul><li><p>Engineer Pro's teaching quality has been proven through a series of BIG TECH offers from students</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Learn directly with  <strong>100% instructors from BIG TECH</strong>  (Google, Meta, TikTok, Uber, Amazon, Spotify, Grab, Shopee, Citadel, ...) - experienced experts, ready to share experiences and practical experience in the technology industry.</p></li><li><p><strong>Master Backend skills:</strong>  The course provides you with the necessary knowledge and skills to become a proficient Backend programmer.</p></li><li><p><strong>Develop programming thinking:</strong>  The course helps you practice logical thinking, problem solving and the ability to learn new things.</p></li><li><p><strong>Understand the operating principles, structure and modules  </strong>of Spring Framework, confidently develop effective and easily maintained Web Backend applications.</p></li></ul><div><div class=\"embed-16x9\"><iframe frameborder=\"0\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_2NLCiWa-9E\"></iframe></div></div><p>Demo session of BACKEND JAVA WITH SPRING course</p><h2><strong>3. Participants and learning form</strong></h2><p><strong>Participants:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Students of IT or related fields.</p></li><li><p>People who are passionate about programming and want to develop a career in the Backend field.</p></li><li><p>Programmers who want to improve their skills and knowledge about Backend.</p></li></ul><p>Entrance requirements: When registering for the course, students must know basic programming (have learned some programming languages at school: C++, Java, Golang...)</p><p><strong>Form of learning:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Convenient form of online learning, easy to arrange time to study and work.</p></li><li><p>Theory combined with practice</p></li><li><p>Students practice practical exercises and projects</p></li></ul><div><p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.hstatic.net/200000696647/file/java_1e0b6d9bfa7841dea408a11207b57f31.jpg\"/></p></div><h2><strong>4. Privileges when being a student at Engineer Pro</strong></h2><ul><li><p>Always receive Mentors Support even after the course has ended</p></li><li><p>Answer all questions during the learning process</p></li><li><p>Join a private group of students, receive the latest and earliest recruitment news from Big Tech</p></li><li><p>Referral Apply to Big Tech</p></li><li><p>Participate in internal Webinars to share knowledge and interview tips</p></li><li><p>Get 1 free Video Pre - Course: Java Fundamentals, Basic Terminal Commands, Code Conventions when registering</p></li></ul><p><strong>What are you waiting for? Hurry up and inbox  <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/EngineerPro.Official\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Engineer Pro  </a>Now for detailed advice and quick registration!</strong></p>"
